<h1 class="md:text-5xl font-semibold text-center">How Pairin can help you?</h1>
<div class="flex gap-8 px-4">
  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-body">
      <h2 class="card-header">Improve your coding skills!</h2>
      <p class="text-content2">It's known fact that pair programming helps you to improve your skills.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-body">
      <h2 class="card-header">Work on something interesting!</h2>
      <p class="text-content2">Our daily work can be boring from time to time, switching context to something more fun can be ... benefitial to your career</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-body">
      <h2 class="card-header">Move out of the comfort zone</h2>
      <p class="text-content2">...</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-body">
      <h2 class="card-header">Meet interesting people</h2>
      <p class="text-content2">...</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="flex h-40 w-full border-black bg-white border-t-4 font-bold">
  <div class="w-1/2 flex flex-col items-center mt-6">
    <div>
      <p class="font-headline">Start pairin</p>

      <p><%= link_to "Sign up", new_user_registration_path %><p>
      <p><%= link_to "Log in", new_user_session_path %><p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex flex-col w-1/2 mt-2 items-center">
    <%= image_tag "logo.svg", alt: "Pairin.dev logo", class: "w-24 h-24" %>
    <span class="block text-sm">made by Manufaktura Koda</span>
  </div>
</div>
